module stratareach

; Reachability over indexed structure.
;
; This layer adds no primitive and widens nothing. The work-queue closure
; and its agreement with the cons-list engine are Strata's own --
; `strata/system/reach.strata` -- and the only thing Meta contributes is
; the source list the checks link.

judgment StrataReachSystem [prelude native octets artifact collections reach] =
  list [prelude native octets artifact collections reach]
